<section class="container page-section"><div class="page-heading mb-4"><div><p class="eyebrow">Pembelajaran • Satu sumber soal</p><h1 class="h2">Bank soal mandiri</h1><p class="text-secondary mb-0">Untuk Latihan Mandiri dan Simulasi Ujian, terpisah dari soal di dalam kursus.</p></div></div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="<?php echo site_url('kelola/bank-soal/0'); ?>">Tambah soal</a><a class="btn btn-teal" href="<?php echo site_url('kelola/bank-soal/impor'); ?>"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-arrow-up me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Impor Word / Excel / TXT</a></div>
 <form method="get" class="feature-card row g-3 mb-4"><div class="col-md-4"><?php echo study_grade_select($grade); ?></div><div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label" for="mapel">Mata pelajaran</label><select class="form-select" id="mapel" name="mapel"><option value="">Semua mapel</option><?php foreach($subjects as $s): ?><option value="<?php echo (int)$s['id']; ?>"<?php echo (string)$subject===(string)$s['id']?' selected':''; ?>><?php echo html_escape($s['name']); ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label" for="status">Status</label><select class="form-select" id="status" name="status"><?php foreach(array('all'=>'Semua','draft'=>'Draft','published'=>'Aktif','archived'=>'Arsip') as $k=>$label): ?><option value="<?php echo $k; ?>"<?php echo $status===$k?' selected':''; ?>><?php echo $label; ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div><div class="col-md-1 align-self-end"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Cari</button></div></form>
 <p>Soal identik memakai ID yang sama, termasuk jika urutan pilihannya berbeda. Perbedaan kunci atau gambar dianggap soal berbeda. Mengedit soal tidak mengubah hasil sesi yang sudah dimulai.</p>
 <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped align-middle"><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Soal</th><th>Status</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($report['rows'] as $q): ?><tr><td>#<?php echo (int)$q['id']; ?></td><td class="text-break"><?php echo html_escape(mb_substr($q['prompt'],0,220)); ?><?php if($q['image_json']): ?> <i class="bi bi-image" aria-label="Memiliki gambar"></i><?php endif; ?></td><td><?php echo html_escape($q['status']); ?></td><td><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" href="<?php echo site_url('kelola/bank-soal/'.(int)$q['id']); ?>">Kelola</a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$report['rows']): ?><tr><td colspan="4">Belum ada soal pada filter ini. Tambahkan soal atau unduh template dan impor bank soal milik Anda.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
 <nav class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3" aria-label="Halaman bank soal"><?php foreach(array(-1=>'Sebelumnya',1=>'Berikutnya') as $step=>$label):if($report['page']+$step>=1&&$report['page']+$step<=max(1,ceil($report['total']/20))): ?><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="<?php echo html_escape(site_url('kelola/bank-soal').'?'.http_build_query(array('kelas'=>$grade,'mapel'=>$subject,'status'=>$status,'halaman'=>$report['page']+$step))); ?>"><?php echo $label; ?></a><?php endif;endforeach; ?><span><?php echo (int)$report['total']; ?> soal · halaman <?php echo (int)$report['page']; ?></span></nav></section>
